 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dec             |   2 -
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc             |   5 -
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf             |   2 -
 10 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 527 deletions(-)
